     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"FR\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi all,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I tried to install dplyr on windows 8 64bits and R302 but i\r\nhave an error message as mentionned below. I have installed Rtools before and\r\nset the variables path.  What this mean ? Thanks a lot<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"1313\" style=\"width:656.5pt\">\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 3.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">&gt; library(&quot;devtools&quot;,\r\n  lib.loc=&quot;D:/PROGS/MyRlibs&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">&gt; devtools::install_github(&quot;dplyr&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#002060\">Installing github repo\r\n  dplyr/master from hadley<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#002060\">Downloading dplyr.zip from\r\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/dplyr/archive/master.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/dplyr/archive/master.zip&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792358261633000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2aPfKNvk1fX-mA72_JKaq2\">https://github.com/hadley/dplyr/archive/master.zip</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;c